    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiya gwanyarja heeda sigadoowaniisa sanaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa sugoocheanda gweargwa, ak ghapka sean gealeabu Yuda, ea Yerusalemu ak ghabwat geat aba headaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'eat sugoocheanda ghwascheang'da gawa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA sea fuga sean bea Yuda, ea gea mida Yerusalemu sean, ea ashoohoodiga, ea sibanga, ea fuga sean was gea manang'i ea gea hees. Ak ghoasoamwa nea ghwayiiy sean ng'asheega sean mida jeeda gitaabooda Neajeeda sinyasa jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada sugoocheanda aba murdeeda daraneeda, ak gwasin neajeeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Bea gideaba gayghwaat geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA nea ghoang'waay diigheanyeekaaschi atamanamughuush, ea muuwuunoadaanyi, ea deaweedajeagaaschi, aba gurooroadaanyi sean ea jeadaanyi sean nea ghwaat geeshta ng'asheegeaba neajeeni sing'oorsa jeedeaba gitaaboani, ak ghamwas buuneesean neajeedida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukusa sugoocheanda Hilkiya was ashoohoocheanda haw, ea ashoohoodiga suurja weat niny, ea furiischoodiga fur gidaghuuta gideaba eeruuta jarooda dabita sean, mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ghayi sisissa Baali, ea Ashera, ea lugoosean mida humng'eeda. Ak gooruuteawa jeeda mujiineeda Yerusalemu ak ghaghwarda aba hoowa, aba jeeda madameega Gidironi, ak ghwaat deareadaanyi ea ghwahita Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghahoan ashoohoodiga bada sanaamu, ghayi iin sugoodiga Yudean gwajoohiisa heeda sibada geediga ng'andidi mida jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda, ea gea neaweesa Yerusalemu, ea gea joohiisa geediga ng'andidi Baali, ea aseeta, ea sheeda, ea miinga, hees, ea miinga sean mida humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'aamwa Ashera jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gwanda jarooda aba Yerusalemu, ea ghwahita moangoachiyda Gidironi. Ak ghaghwarda aba moangoachiyda Gidironi, nea gagul ea ghoah birjeanda ak gwajaksa birjeandida badayda bung'eadinga buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanyarja gealga headiga hiseaday aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was heeda abiita gadeemga sina gheareedanga hang'weaka geawi bea Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gooruuteawa ashoohoodiga sean jeeda mujiineeda Yuda, ak gwanuus meetiida heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda, joohiisa ashoohoodiga geediga ng'andidi. Ghang'eada Geba ea ghwahita Beer-sheba, ak gwanyarja gidaghuuta dooshta heesibadiini ghadooweeda, deaschi dooshta Yoshuwa was sugoocheanda ambaliischi bea mujiini, mida meatkweeda geatinda ghaadaam bea mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ashoohoodigiga bea heeda sibadiini ghadooweedean, ea miighwascheang'da gaweay heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA mida Yerusalemu, ak ghwaak mukaateeyda miyeamwatawiit aba bugusta fuga nyaawa duupchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanuus meetiida Dofeti mida moangoachiyda orjooga Hinomu. Gideaba siida adaghaghwarda orjeedaanyi ghana hudaanyi ghoah haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda bea Moleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanda faraasajeega ghayi adaw sugoodiga Yuda aseeta, aba gidaghuuta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, neekeewa ghooriida Natan-meleki, was siida ghayi sigul. Ak ghaghwarda mutukwajeega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heeda wagiida mida uhuuda gheeda Ahasi, ghayi sin sugoodiga Yuda, ea heeda wagiida ghayi sin Manase mida jeeda seamoodeaba iyeenya bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA gwanyarja ak goorareang'u ak gwajaksa birjeandaanyi jeeda moangoachiyda Gidironi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwar sugoocheanda meetiida heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda mida gayeewda Yerusalemu ea ghwahita wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea giijeeda riing'eeda ghayi deas sugoocheanda Israeli was Sulemani deeksa Ashtoreti was aseecheeka fuga Sidoni ea Gemoshi ea Moabu ea Milkomu ea gea orjooga fuga Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwahirjeaweada daranajeega, nea ghwalajaada Asherimu, ak gwadaksa ng'eanyoojigiga geaka buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwanyarja heeda wagiida mida Beteli, ea heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda ghayi deas Yeroboamu orjeeda Nebati, ghayi nung' gwasin fuga Israeli riing'eeda, hoowa bea wagiidean gwanyarjeaweada ea heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda. Ak ghang'at ea ghoah birjeanda, nea ghaghwarda Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ang'wearda Yosiya ghwadaah bung'eadinga mida hoowa bea uhuuda giijeedean, ak goojeakta buuneeda. Ak gooruudu geakiga mida jeeda bung'eadingean ng'ata ghaghwarda aba heeda wagiida, ak ghabwara ririnnyeanda gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, rugu siidida bea ASEETEAN aba gidarukuteayda ng'asheesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi, “Nih giipkeateabeang'a, nih aadaayiin?” Ghwalamda fuga mujiini ak gwayeesha niny, “Bung'eeda siidida bea ASEETEAN gil, leabu Yuda, ak gwarugu ng'asheesu iisini ang'iing'iin aba badayda heeda wagiida bea Beteli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Anung'waada adoasachi geakaaschi.” Hean geanung'waada geakaaschi sea geaka sibaneedida leabu ng'eanyiida Samariyahiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gealga sean bea heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda mida ng'eanyiida Samariya, ghayi deas sugoodiga Israeli ak ghwanung' ghwanyareas NG'UTAMIIDA, hean gwanyarja Yosiya ak gwahinda gidaghayi hinda sean aba Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanuuseada ashoohoodiga sean mida hoowa bea heeda sibadiini ghadooweedean aba heeda wagiida. Ak ghaghwarda geaka buuneeda aba badayda nyaawa ak gabiikta Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiya gwasin ghweelmeeda Basaaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa sugoocheanda buuneesean nea gwayeesha, “Asisiina Basaaka NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, gawuurji gissing'oarda aba jeedeaba gitaaboani bea neajeedeani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa miyeesin basaakeeda uurji nih, ghang'eada damanda fuga aheeldooschi buuneeda, nea abeeda gooheeldooschi Israeli, eara damanda sugoodiga Israeli ghana damanda sugoodiga Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geaghus gweaydeaba damasis bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yosiya geesissa basaakeeda uurji nih NG'UTAMIIDA aba Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda suuk sin Yosiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya gooruuteawa hoowa giijoodiga, ea beeneediga ea aseecheeka, ea sanaamu, ea haleanjeeda munyas bea riing'eeda daah aba ng'eanyiida Yuda ea Yerusalemu. Ak gwasa ng'asheega deaweeda sing'oorsa gitaaboadida ghayi nyas Hilkiya was ashoohoocheanda aba jeeda ghooriida NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda miighwahina niny manda sugoocheanda uurji niny, aat geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA aba gurooroadaanyi sean ea jeadaanyi sean, ea aba uurdaanyi sean, gawuurji gidanyaashta deaweedajeega sean bea Musa; ak ea manda dea jea ghwahidu uurji niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak NG'UTAMIIDA ea miighwanung'waada ng'weaninda nyarastaanyi haw. Aba gideaba ghwanyareas aba badayda Yuda, aba ng'asheega munyas sean nung' Manase ghwanyareas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Gaydaang'aamwa eara Yuda madeedeanyu, gawuurji gidang'amdi Israeli, ak gaydajakta mujiineani ghayi aaloachiin, Yerusalemu ea gheeda ghayi eargu gideaba, gheawungeasu gaygwanda hoowa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muudeanooda sugoocheanduumeeda Yosiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Yosiya, heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda waseewa Yosiya sugoocheanda, hean ghwascheang'da Farao-neko, was sugoocheanda Misri gang'uchi sea sugoocheanda Ashuru. Hean hita eenda Furati, gawa Yosiya gwaroonyi sea niny, hean ghabwar Farao-neko niny aba Megido damanda daaha niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiin fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda badayda mutuku ak geasar nea nimi. Ak geang'eada Megido ak geayaat ea eahita Yerusalemu, ak geebung'sa niny jeeda bung'eadaanyi. Ng'ata gageanu fuga ng'eanyiida Yehoahasi orjeeda Yosiya ak geamwaar aba nagheeda, ak geenung' gawa hoorgeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ghwaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi was sugoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea samwagu. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew samwagu aba Yerusalemu, ak gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Hamutali was hudeaba Yeremiya bea Libina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji geaghayi sin ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'waay Farao-neko niny ak gwajaksa ghealooniga aba Ribla aba ng'eanyiida Hamati. Aba gideaba adaghoah sugoocheanda aba Yerusalemu, ak ghwanung' ghoadayda buuneeda gwaadi dalaantaji bughala bea lapiya ea gea dahaabu siguura dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Farao-neko ghwanung' ghoah Eliyakimu was orjeeda Yosiya sugoocheanda, gawa hoorgeeda Yosiya was ghoan, ak ghwayam gheawungaaschi ghoah Yehoyakimu. Ak ghoang'aamwa hiji Yehoahasi ak goodeayi Misri, ak gameewsa hoowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw Yehoyakimu Farao dahaabu siguura dahaabu ea lapiya. Ak ghwanung' gooruuta buuneeda gwaadi, gawuurji gidarukusiinda Farao. Ak ghwanung' ghoadayda buuneeda lapiya ea dahaabu siguura dahaabu ak gaba nih adayda gwaadeadaanyi, ak geataw Farao-neko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew damwanagi aba Yerusalemu, ak gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Sebida hudeaba Bedaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji gea ghayi sin ghweanigaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
